        "rawMarkdown": "It says in www.kaggle.com/competitions/gemma-4-developer-agent/overview/model-selection-budget-and-harness-rules :\n>At present, we only support the gemma-4-31b-it-qat-w4a16-ct Gemma 4 model variant. You must choose this model for every agent and subagent.\n\nThe idea is not that you upload your own model/checkpoint. You must upload a LoRA that is applied to this model.",
        "content": "<p>It says in <a href=\"http://www.kaggle.com/competitions/gemma-4-developer-agent/overview/model-selection-budget-and-harness-rules\" target=\"_blank\">www.kaggle.com/competitions/gemma-4-developer-agent/overview/model-selection-budget-and-harness-rules</a> :</p>\n<blockquote>\n  <p>At present, we only support the gemma-4-31b-it-qat-w4a16-ct Gemma 4 model variant. You must choose this model for every agent and subagent.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>The idea is not that you upload your own model/checkpoint. You must upload a LoRA that is applied to this model.</p>",
