            "id": 3528109,
            "postDate": "2026-09-25T11:37:02.453Z",
            "rawMarkdown": "Harness file says, any one of the below variants can be used. We can't use 2 different variants.\n\n\"All agents in a submission must declare at most ONE unique base model (len(models) == 1). Declaring two different base models (e.g., gemma-4-31b-it in the root agent and gemma-4-9b-it in a sub-agent) raises ParticipantVisibleError.\"\n\ngemma-4-31b-it-qat-w4a16-ct (Starter Kit default)\ngemma-4-31b-it, gemma-4-31b\ngemma-4-27b-it, gemma-4-27b\ngemma-4-26b-a4b-it, gemma-4-26b-a4b, diffusiongemma-26b-a4b-it\ngemma-4-12b-it, gemma-4-12b\ngemma-4-9b-it, gemma-4-9b\ngemma-4-e4b-it, gemma-4-e4b\ngemma-4-e2b-it, gemma-4-e2b",
            "content": "<p>Harness file says, any one of the below variants can be used. We can't use 2 different variants.</p>\n<p>\"All agents in a submission must declare at most ONE unique base model (len(models) == 1). Declaring two different base models (e.g., gemma-4-31b-it in the root agent and gemma-4-9b-it in a sub-agent) raises ParticipantVisibleError.\"</p>\n<p>gemma-4-31b-it-qat-w4a16-ct (Starter Kit default)\ngemma-4-31b-it, gemma-4-31b\ngemma-4-27b-it, gemma-4-27b\ngemma-4-26b-a4b-it, gemma-4-26b-a4b, diffusiongemma-26b-a4b-it\ngemma-4-12b-it, gemma-4-12b\ngemma-4-9b-it, gemma-4-9b\ngemma-4-e4b-it, gemma-4-e4b\ngemma-4-e2b-it, gemma-4-e2b</p>",
